        <widget class="QLabel" name="shortcutsIntro">
         <property name="text"><string>These are Kwilt's &lt;b&gt;default&lt;/b&gt; keys. To change one, open &lt;b&gt;System Settings → Shortcuts&lt;/b&gt; and search for “Kwilt”. A default only takes effect if no other shortcut holds that key: Plasma's Quick Tile (Meta+Arrows), Move Window to Screen (Meta+Shift+Left/Right), Switch Window (Meta+Alt+Arrows) and the Meta+Tab half of Walk Through Windows clash out of the box. Clear them there, or run &lt;code&gt;scripts/setup-shortcuts.sh&lt;/code&gt; from the Kwilt repository.</string></property>
